# C3: safe-write artefacts. .bak is the last-known-good copy of a ledger —
# it is operational state, not source. Never commit it, never delete it by hand.
*.bak
.*.tmp-*
*.lock

# ── 2026-07-26: the remaining untracked-but-not-ignored paths ──
# A commit meant for 5 files swept in 244 of these because they were merely
# untracked, not ignored. Listed explicitly rather than as a blanket data/*.json,
# because data/config-overrides.json and data/migrations/ ARE source.
SCREEENSHOTS/
*.pdf
*.docx
backtest-real-results.json
bt-data/result-validate.json
data/hist-index/
data/hist-options/
